{
  "id": 21,
  "name": "progress_weighted_regret",
  "intent": "Modulate the regret coefficient by tour progress so late-stage selections prioritize insertion urgency when remaining options are limited; distance dominates early when the candidate pool is large, reducing regret noise in greedy construction.",
